  "isoDate": "2026-08-18T09:35:27+07:00",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.tvonenews.com/ekonomi/460665-harga-emas-antam-hari-ini-18-agustus-2026-naik-rp18000-jadi-rp2695000-per-gram",
